---
title: "C24 — Eight CI lanes and release gates · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Trigger[PR, main push or manual workflow] --> Build[Workspace build]
  Trigger --> Lint[Workspace lint, commitlint and Actionlint]
  Trigger --> Test[Workspace test excluding UI package]
  Trigger --> UI[UI components and Storybook tests]
  Trigger --> Types[Workspace typecheck]
  Trigger --> Format[Workspace format check]
  Trigger --> Prod[Compose production check]
  Trigger --> Dev[Compose live-update check]
  Build --> Join[All eight checks must pass]
  Lint --> Join
  Test --> Join
  UI --> Join
  Types --> Join
  Format --> Join
  Prod --> Join
  Dev --> Join
  Join --> MainOnly{Non-PR main run?}
  MainOnly -->|Yes| Publish[Publish affected app images to GHCR]
  MainOnly -->|No| Complete[PR checks complete]
  Publish --> Enabled{CD_ENABLED and protected settings?}
  Enabled -->|Yes| Demo[Temporary Vercel source deployment]
  Enabled -->|No| Skip[Deployment skipped]
